-discovery","title":"AI驱动的药物发现","url":"/h/corporate-management/pfizer/ai-transformation/ai-drug-discovery"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ai-manufacturing","title":"AI智能制造与质量控制","url":"/h/corporate-management/pfizer/ai-transformation/ai-manufacturing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-workforce-impact","title":"AI对辉瑞岗位的冲击与重塑","url":"/h/corporate-management/pfizer/ai-transformation/ai-workforce-impact"},{"seq":4,"slug":"ai-practice-guide","title":"辉瑞员工AI实践指南","url":"/h/corporate-management/pfizer/ai-transformation/ai-practice-guide"}]}]}